{"nodes": [{"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_uzcasting_mobile_platform", "label": "UzCasting Mobile Platform", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three products fused in one app (casting portfolio, paid premieres, creator economy) because the monetization loop needs creators, content and buyers on the same surface."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_monetization_core_flow", "label": "Monetization Core Flow (free episode 1 to paid continuation)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a71 \u042f\u0434\u0440\u043e \u043c\u043e\u043d\u0435\u0442\u0438\u0437\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0438", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Blogger posts episode 1 free on YouTube/Instagram, CTA sends viewers to UzCasting to buy the continuation; payment confirmed -> entitlement -> protected player; 50/50 revenue share. Everything else in the app is scaffolding around this single scenario."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_design_system_palette", "label": "Mobile Design System Palette", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Seven HEX tokens are fixed by the client spec (V2 p.18) and may not change; six derived neutral/status tokens were added by the team because the eight mandatory states cannot be built without them. Source of truth is tailwind.config.js plus src/theme/tokens.ts, both must be edited together."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_eight_mandatory_ui_states", "label": "Eight Mandatory UI States", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "loading/empty/error/success/locked/purchased/disabled/offline required on every screen; implementation split across ScreenState, Button and Badge so a screen is not 'done' until all applicable states are covered."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_five_tab_navigation", "label": "Five Tab Navigation (Bosh sahifa/Casting/Premyera/Xabarlar/Profil)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tab composition comes from the client spec, not from Yangi.TV; Creator Studio is a section inside Profil rather than a sixth tab so the bar matches the approved mockups."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_screen_inventory", "label": "26-Screen Inventory and Status", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_ten_creator_directions", "label": "Ten Creator Directions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "V3 only details catalogs for 7 of the 10; Styling and Courses have no screens, and the backend only has 4 of the 10 casting types, so 6 directions honestly render an empty state."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_mobile_tech_stack", "label": "Mobile Tech Stack (Expo SDK 57)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "expo-router, NativeWind+Tailwind (shares the palette config with the web frontend), TanStack Query for server state, Zustand for client state, axios for token interceptors, expo-web-browser + uzcasting:// deeplink because Click/Payme/Uzum ship no native RN SDKs."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_expo_router_pitfalls", "label": "Expo Router / NativeWind Pitfalls", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "From SDK 56 expo-router is incompatible with direct @react-navigation imports; babel-preset-expo must be in devDependencies for NativeWind; app.json scheme uzcasting is required for return from the payment webview; lib/api.ts must attach the Authorization header or paid content and the player return 404."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_phone_or_google_auth", "label": "Phone-OTP or Google Sign-In (interchangeable)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a74 \u0410\u0432\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0437\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Phone is not requested after Google because the spec explicitly allows an email account and names social login as optional; the number is collected later, where payouts and payments actually need it. Requires three Google OAuth clients (Android, iOS, Web)."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_home_server_feed", "label": "Server-Driven Home Feed (GET /api/v1/app/home)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a75, \u00a77", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Home is an array of typed blocks assembled by the server; otherwise every storefront change would need a store release."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_watch_entitlement_api", "label": "Watch Entitlement API (/api/v1/app/watch/**)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a75 screen 17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Access right, reason and price all come from the server, never decided client-side."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_contenttype_vs_structuretype", "label": "contentType is not structureType", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 \u0413\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043b\u0438", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Type (serial, show) cannot tell whether content is whole or episodic - they are different axes of the spec; the client only learns the structure from the /watch response."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_work_stages", "label": "Mobile Work Stages 0-4", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a77", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stage 1 (design) blocks development because the spec states Figma is the final source of truth; stage 3 is Android+UZ/RU, stage 4 iOS+EN."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_open_questions", "label": "Open Questions to the Client (mobile)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Styling/Courses catalogs, Latin vs Cyrillic Uzbek, refund rules, DRM vs signed URLs, and who grants the verified badge remain unanswered; the episode price was cut from 5000 to 3000 on 13.08.2026."}, {"id": "mobile_docs_roadmap_mockups_not_reference", "label": "V4 Mockups Are Not a Layout Reference", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The PDF images are AI-generated collages with unreadable text and a repeated 10-phone grid; only the tab-bar composition, dark-purple gamma, rounded cards, pink PREMYERA badge and gold withdraw button are trustworthy. Real designs are rebuilt from scratch in Figma."}], "edges": [{"source": "mobile_docs_roadmap_uzcasting_mobile_platform", "target": "mobile_docs_structure_yangi_tv_analysis", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "header link to STRUCTURE.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mobile_docs_roadmap_design_system_palette", "target": "tz_uzcasting_premium_uiux_texnik_topshiriq_v2_premium_design_system", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a72 '\u0438\u0437 \u0422\u0417, V2 \u0441\u0442\u0440. 18'", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mobile_docs_roadmap_five_tab_navigation", "target": "tz_uzcasting_premium_uiux_texnik_topshiriq_v2_navigation_role_system", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a74 '\u0438\u0437 \u0422\u0417 (V2 \u0441\u0442\u0440. 19)'", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mobile_docs_roadmap_screen_inventory", "target": "tz_uzcasting_0dan_toliq_uiux_texnik_topshiriq_v3_screen_catalog", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a75 '26 \u044d\u043a\u0440\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432 \u0438\u0437 V3'", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mobile_docs_roadmap_eight_mandatory_ui_states", "target": "tz_uzcasting_0dan_toliq_uiux_texnik_topshiriq_v3_mandatory_ui_states", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mobile_docs_roadmap_ten_creator_directions", "target": "tz_uzcasting_premium_uiux_texnik_topshiriq_v2_ten_directions", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "mobile/docs/ROADMAP.md", "source_location": "\u00a75 '\u0438\u0437 \u0422\u0417, V2 \u0441\u0442\u0440. 2'", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mobile_docs_roadmap_ten_creato